# --- discern ---
# discern's managed ignore rules: machine-local provider state only.
# The skills discern materializes are ignored by an ignore file inside
# each provider skills directory that lists just those entries, so
# skills other tools install beside them stay visible to Git. discern
# owns this block alone and never touches your other rules. The
# compiled agent files (AGENTS.md and its mirrors) are tracked, so
# every agent — cloud included — reads them from a fresh clone. For
# the full list of discern-managed files, run `discern docs` or see
# https://discern.sh
/.claude/settings.local.json
# --- /discern ---
